 "_comment_reserved_for": "reserved_for: a state exam any Indian can sit, with reservation (and usually fee and age concessions) for that state's residents. Shown in the All India list and in that state's list.",
 "_comment_recruitment": "recruitment: an armed forces entry that recruits into a job (Agniveer, Coast Guard, commissions through AFCAT, TGC/SSC Tech, Navy SSC, NCC entry), labelled 'Recruitment exam'. NDA, CDS, Army TES and the Navy 10+2 B.Tech entry admit to an academy and stay 'Entrance exam'. Every Government Jobs exam is a recruitment."
